data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","item_id":"rs_099f593c06878f30016acb983462f88196a729f75b98492f12","output_index":0,"sequence_number":100,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Working on SSR HTML forms**\n\nI'm implementing simple server-side rendering for HTML forms with a native post redirect, ensuring no JavaScript is needed since it should work in any browser. If there's a server error, I want a blank alert for a 422 status that will rerender the rows. I need to ensure the detail route uses a properly escaped UUID. Also, I’ll run tests that involve spinning up a temporary database and restarting health routes for sanitization. I hope I have enough tokens and time for this!"}

